/span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SANvK175VaJ7FbBNJWgLoPCTLH62GskxuO0rAsZQUV7tR7BdyJ2EaOvj99todDAUEFvy4RghMyLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;text-align: center;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;\">\n            关于El Diviso\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n          El Diviso位于慧兰的Pitalito镇，庄园的主人Jose Uribe Lasso为了远离暴力的生活环境，从娜玲珑搬到了Pitalito，于2000年初购得了El Diviso，开始新的生活篇章。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n          选择慧兰，是因为肥沃的土壤与健康多样的生态环境，给了Jose信心，只要努力，种咖啡或者其它任何作物都可以很好的生活下去。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QZPe6Sx1X6TK2tJ8QFJ3YUcIF273zIuy1ZU5jFArz9zI185xo4Vyb695rr2K5wRK4AibZ4KzNMxXw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Jose将庄园分割了不同的地块分别给它的3个儿子，让他们选择想种的咖啡品种，鼓励他们自己选择合适的处理加工方式，现在庄园里有种植的品种有瑰夏，爪哇，卡杜拉，粉波旁以及一种叫Bourbon Aji的波旁品种。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QZPe6Sx1X6TK2tJ8QFJ3YU3Bj6762m13NztjM5ibBvlptBAMElanYFwb9CaCpWeh4ouSNfTwCrkRw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QZPe6Sx1X6TK2tJ8QFJ3YUniccGB66DxC3Ixnf7YLxkz3PDzJwQricOh0PdIXYVlCPgib3lZYgDI33Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QZPe6Sx1X6TK2tJ8QFJ3YUbicrTE9u2icxlQ4SGOFPUVobMGVH3J17cycexaXicREFRwAxHgTrkX6Aw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于这个批次的处理：\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n           - 选择成熟度好的咖啡果，有氧发酵12个小时左右，平均温度为18至22℃；随后脱除果皮，脱除过程中的果胶液收集起来放入后续的发酵过程中\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           - 有氧发酵12小时，加入酵母（酿酒酵母）在39℃的温度下进行浸没式发酵72小时，浸出物再循环。为了完成发酵，进行热冲击（在平均温度为65-70℃的热水中清洗咖啡，结束发酵过程）。\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           - 开始在最高温度为30°C的雨棚中干燥，平均18和24天，使其湿度降至11%。\n          </span>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QZPe6Sx1X6TK2tJ8QFJ3YUpA5ibKohtWAvoIg8VpCtuXibiaAvbPRaGASotejCQiamW0uKFyWFjx9Ezw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0em;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          <br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 431px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
